{
  "name": "Scout's Swiftness",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can roll a Combat Superiority Die without expending it and add it to your initiative.</p><p>Additionally, when initiative is rolled but before the first round of combat, you can expend a Combat Superiority Die to move up to your Speed and make a single weapon attack. If it hits, you add your Combat Superiority Die to the damage roll.</p>",
